WEBVTT

00:00:00.540 --> 00:00:01.070
Hello!

00:00:01.168 --> 00:00:03.070
New looks, a weekend offer:

00:00:03.177 --> 00:00:05.230
how do you let your regulars know straight away?

00:00:05.578 --> 00:00:08.669
Every salon on VaraaAi has its own Fanpage.

00:00:08.790 --> 00:00:11.950
You post, and your followers see it right away in their feed.

00:00:12.484 --> 00:00:13.708
Tap Fanpage.

00:00:13.817 --> 00:00:17.468
At the top are your posts, followers, likes and comments.

00:00:17.738 --> 00:00:19.708
Below is the box to write a post:

00:00:19.786 --> 00:00:20.988
type your text here.

00:00:21.614 --> 00:00:23.070
Choose a label for the post:

00:00:23.180 --> 00:00:26.590
Offer, New work, News, or Beauty tip.

00:00:27.020 --> 00:00:30.283
Then choose a button under the post, for example Book now,

00:00:30.233 --> 00:00:32.830
so customers go straight to your booking page.

00:00:33.449 --> 00:00:36.030
Tap Photos or Video to add pictures;

00:00:36.187 --> 00:00:38.030
one post can have several photos.

00:00:38.379 --> 00:00:40.430
To publish later, tap Schedule.

00:00:40.720 --> 00:00:43.390
For an important post, tap Pin to top.

00:00:43.601 --> 00:00:45.070
Then tap Post.

00:00:45.656 --> 00:00:48.737
Your post appears on your salon's Fanpage straight away,

00:00:48.687 --> 00:00:50.849
with its photo and the Book now button.

00:00:51.297 --> 00:00:53.889
Customers can like, comment and share it.

00:00:54.265 --> 00:00:59.009
Tap View fanpage to see the page as customers do, or Copy link to send it to them.

00:00:59.437 --> 00:01:00.609
Now take the quiz below.
